 \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=1\n$$\n\nSubstituting $y=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}$ into the above and solving for $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3})}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+(\\frac{5}{9}) & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =1-\\frac{5}{9} \\\\ {x}^{2} & =\\frac{4}{9} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{4}{9}} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we select the negative answer since $x$ is negative in the second quadrant. So our final answer is $x=-\\frac{2}{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-124822/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "021e3349-c54d-55a8-9095-902bba933660"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124822"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-23289/selection/b9212a7dc50df6db470ed57909d5979dd937b8bd5951cc71691ce3e895d78b34" :answer/id #uuid "3b0673b7-0798-5c63-8942-39a2f614e2e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23289/selection/5146b966b45cb257f5b00597e963a661d0901642773e1ea6e81980c95fb13f8e" :answer/id #uuid "81ab70de-abf8-5e3d-889e-06ee1bea01c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\sqrt{23}}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23289/selection/1defb2475f732878107774d07f4ed478a9f49794bc89182ed6eb4c6b9c22e2ae" :answer/id #uuid "2a56d1d3-abf2-5c7b-8133-ed6a5a0360e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\sqrt{29}}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23289/selection/3bbcc24f02e94d2f6b051ecd592deb2413c624c6a48a5f63543e5436a8bd46b3" :answer/id #uuid "7da59c67-2616-5302-95c4-796b28547383" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{23}}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23289/selection/5b9949bb6fec012c2ada91e4fe4cef4f51a5c2054af4ce695d60094edaa439d7" :answer/id #uuid "a329c9c8-ff11-5a9f-9193-8ffaa4041b64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=